{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure, what is the ratio of the area of the gray squares to the area of the white squares?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/4/3c4476181cee26306aeb555b3e4b864d592dca35.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size((70)); draw((10,0)--(0,10)--(-10,0)--(0,-10)--(10,0)); draw((-2.5,-7.5)--(7.5,2.5)); draw((-5,-5)--(5,5)); draw((-7.5,-2.5)--(2.5,7.5)); draw((-7.5,2.5)--(2.5,-7.5)); draw((-5,5)--(5,-5)); draw((-2.5,7.5)--(7.5,-2.5)); fill((-10,0)--(-7.5,2.5)--(-5,0)--(-7.5,-2.5)--cycle, gray); fill((-5,0)--(0,5)--(5,0)--(0,-5)--cycle, gray); fill((5,0)--(7.5,2.5)--(10,0)--(7.5,-2.5)--cycle, gray); [/asy]\" width=\"118\" height=\"118\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/8/d38d53066bec9e63260b7c929f0191e49b359177.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3:10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3:8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3:7 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3:5 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1:1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Dividing the gray square into four smaller squares, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gray tiles and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> white tiles, giving a ratio of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afbdd8aedd758e05c5ff566199d822ce961c2f44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3:5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"81\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AM